  "_notes": [
    "Each story entry defines: position (ordering), screenshot_id, background, and layout overrides.",
    "background.style: 'mesh' (4-corner colors) or 'gradient' (color1/color2); background.theme drives text color selection.",
    "layout.{orientation}.text_box.start/height are fractions of canvas height; align = left/center/right (controls text gravity).",
    "layout.{orientation}.layers array is rendered in order; each layer supports:",
    "  type: 'screenshot' (pulls Step-2 output) or 'asset' (relative path under tool-screenshots/).",
    "  source: screenshot identifier (defaults to current screenshot_id, 'primary'); assets use 'path' instead.",
    "  width: fraction of canvas width (0..1), rotation in degrees (around anchor), anchor (center/left/right/top/bottom combos).",
    "  offset.x/.y are normalized positions (0=top/left, 0.5=center) used with the anchor to place the layer.",
    "If layout for a given orientation is missing, fall back to layout.default, otherwise to layout_defaults in 3-background.json.",
    "Canvas sizes per device/orientation live in config/3-background.json; fonts/text sizes live in config/4-text.json.",
    "Set CONFIG=test (or another profile name) to limit Step 3/4 processing to the profile’s languages/devices."
  ]
